<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bk sets Chinese Est warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bk sets Chinese Est warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Friday it launched 480 million American-style call warrants on shares of Chinese Estates Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$7.31	  PREMIUM	 12.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.2391	GEARING	 3.6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION 02.FEB.98 PAYDATE 03.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  05.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$8.60	  EXER LOT	40,000</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
